{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>觀塘繞道發生車禍。今日（15日）大約清晨6時正值返工上班繁忙時段，一輛豐田混能車沿觀塘繞道往尖沙咀方向行駛，途經申新大廈對開時，懷疑失控「自</p><p>就現場所見，涉事豐田仍然「反肚」，零件跌落，司機在場協助警方調查，受車禍影響，現場交通擠塞。</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260515/1131844787570348032246590.jpeg/FR1EvW01e2hZVtqXUvuuXywwx1qvGAocCUeCFDNHghQ\" alt=\"涉事豐田仍然「反肚」。（黃偉民攝）\"><figcaption>涉事豐田仍然「反肚」。（黃偉民攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260515/1131844573056733184921385.jpeg/rtmxxIajq238B-e2VqeS9-A2d_TUJWqFuiEt-ZAhLfk\" alt=\"司機在場協助警方調查。（翁鈺輝攝）\"><figcaption>司機在場協助警方調查。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260515/1131844790468743168167902.jpeg/prEX5y1sNS_TRNSZqyXqrzBbx_UHtWX0WX03znN9N84\" alt=\"零件跌落。（黃偉民攝）\"><figcaption>零件跌落。（黃偉民攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260515/1131844784638398464650178.jpeg/5SbzKC9DFk8DB3PGPuPfgaC4R00sYMC2TbRaH3e0Wh8\" alt=\"涉事豐田仍然「反肚」。（黃偉民攝）\"><figcaption>涉事豐田仍然「反肚」。（黃偉民攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260515/1131844406828077056268301.jpeg/Vl6KDIADQZnt4qwaou617MP8CXCLfRfgemzz0kBs89I\" alt=\"受車禍影響，現場交通擠塞。（翁鈺輝攝）\"><figcaption>受車禍影響，現場交通擠塞。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-14T22:42:43.542330+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":203,"images":5,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}